Spoilers!























Unicorn horns are nice. Apply an uncursed one and get stats restored,
blindness cured, possibly confusion or hallucination (I'm not sure of
those), and maybe some other ones. Blessed ones always do it all, and
you can just keep on applying an uncursed horn until you get the 
effect you want. Dipping a unicorn horn in a bad potion (sickness I'm
sure of, maybe confusion or others as well) and it turns into water.
It also makes a nice rustproof weapon, although you need two hands to
use it.

Worm teeth are pretty useless, but if you enchant one, it turns into
a Crysknife, which is a pretty good weapon, for a non-artifact. But
don't drop it, or it turns into a worm tooth again.

